a ɛfata","poem":1},{"text":"na momfa mo werɛ nhyɛ Awurade mu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Nnipa bebree bisa sɛ:","poem":1},{"text":"“Hwan na ɔbɛtumi ayɛ yɛn adɔeɛ?”","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ao Awurade, ma wʼanim hann no nhyerɛn yɛn so.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Wode anigyeɛ mmorosoɔ ahyɛ mʼakoma ma","poem":1},{"text":"asene ɛberɛ a wɔn aburoo ne nsã foforɔ abu so no.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Mɛtɔ hɔ, na mada asomdwoeɛ mu,","poem":1},{"text":"ɛfiri sɛ, wo nko ara, Ao Awurade,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"na woma metena asomdwoeɛ mu.","poem":2},{"text":"Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ sɛ wɔmfa atɛntɛbɛn nto.","descriptive":true}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/twi_asa/PSA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/twi_asa/PSA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/twi_asa/PSA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}